n", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "ae2555b7-7769-5e4e-a54c-007fe98c5f0b"}, {"title": "明宣宗回京，将朱高煦拘禁于西内", "description": "宣德元年九月丙申，明宣宗朱瞻基自武定州回到京师，将朱高煦拘禁于西内。", "start_year": 1426, "end_year": 1426, "time_original": "宣德元年九月丙申", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "daef5c56-e6c2-5f5e-9472-8a6a46b0f028"}, {"title": "司法官审理朱高煦同谋案，明宣宗下令不追究两王", "description": "宣德元年九月戊戌，司法官审问朱高煦的同谋者，供词牵涉晋王、赵王，明宣宗下诏不加追究。", "start_year": 1426, "end_year": 1426, "time_original": "宣德元年九月戊戌", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "1615db90-90b7-5c5e-a827-1926e4a04300"}, {"title": "李时勉获释并恢复侍读官职", "description": "宣德元年十月戊寅，明廷释放李时勉，恢复他的侍读官职。", "start_year": 1426, "end_year": 1426, "time_original": "宣德元年十月戊寅", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "37f4dd7d-792f-5f8f-a1b4-d7315dfe3f45"}, {"title": "王通在应平败于黎利所部", "description": "宣德元年十一月乙未，成山侯王通在应平进攻黎利所部，战斗失利。", "start_year": 1426, "end_year": 1426, "time_original": "宣德元年十一月乙未", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "0111b305-1fa7-5d3b-a454-633fff42b5f4"}, {"title": "陈洽在交阯作战时身亡", "description": "宣德元年（年号对照1426年）十一月，陈洽在交阯作战时身亡。原历日期只能确定在公元1426年至1427年之间，保留发生范围。", "start_year": null, "end_year": null, "time_original": "宣德元年（年号对照1426年）十一月；发生于公元1426至1427年之间，原文未标具体日。", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_modern_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": 